      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ABE KEEPING (8) was prominent throughout when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when 4th and beaten 6 lengths at this track (18.72). Has good speed and will be prominent from out wide. Has ability and looks hard to stop. TRALEE BUBBA (4) looks close to win after hitting the frame last run (19.22) at this track in a Grade 5. Has first look at box 4 this time. Can feature again. SCOTCH ALL ROUND (7) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 8th at this track following on from a third place finish (19.33) there the start prior. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Worth another chance. MAHOME GIRL (1) did a good job to finish second last time out over 400m at this track (23.38) in a Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
